From 97df27245adf59adb89352af2a6d0f05ce3e4fc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manu <manu4.2012@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:03:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Packaging (.deb/.rpm, install.sh), icon and resizable columns

- Games table columns are resizable and movable; column widths, panel
  sizes and window layout persist in ~/.config/retroscrappy/ui.ini
- Application icon (SVG master + rendered PNGs), window icon, AppStream
  metainfo; desktop file moved to packaging/linux
- GPL-3.0-only LICENSE and project metadata
- packaging/build-deb.sh and build-rpm.sh produce architecture-independent
  packages installing to /opt/retroscrappy with launchers in /usr/bin
- GitHub Actions: lint/tests, build, install tests on Debian trixie,
  Ubuntu rolling and Fedora, release with SHA256SUMS on v* tags
- install.sh: virtual-environment install for immutable systems
  (--user/--system, --version/--ref, --no-gui, --uninstall)
- Version 0.4.0

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Sto8EkXHpPudWUAHo72SfR
